# Agent configuration and the working notes. NEVER TRACKED — that is the whole guard, and it is the
# same one every other ship in the fleet uses. This repository is public and is pushed to directly;
# a file git does not track cannot be leaked by a push, an IDE, or a forgotten step. There is no
